# NOTE: `/hooks/*.mjs` is deliberately NOT ignored — see A25 in docs/WORLD_MODEL.md.
# The built hook bundles are committed because the plugin marketplace clones this repo's
# default branch, so a bundle that exists only in a tag or only in the npm tarball is a
# bundle the installed plugin does not have. CI enforces that they match src/hooks/*.ts.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.env.local
coverage/

